TITLE:: Probe
summary:: Real-time audio visualization, instrumentation, and signal tracing suite for SuperCollider
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/SCVisuals, Classes/ProbeSpectralDashboard, Classes/ProbeBandAnalyzer, Classes/ProbeInspector

DESCRIPTION::
Probe is a professional, high-performance real-time audio visualization and instrumentation suite for SuperCollider.
It provides precision oscilloscopes with zero-crossing stationary trigger edge locking, logarithmic/linear FFT spectrum analyzers with multi-mode views, ITU-R BS.1770 loudness metering, transparent in-graph signal tracing (link::Classes/UGen#-trace::), multi-preset advanced spectral dashboards, and static DSP graph inspection.

Probe maintains strict non-interference with vanilla SuperCollider core methods (link::Classes/Server#-meter::, link::Classes/Server#-scope::, link::Classes/Server#-freqscope:: are unchanged).

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: meter
Opens a vertical server meter.
argument:: server
The target server.
argument:: numIns
Number of input channels.
argument:: numOuts
Number of output channels.
argument:: theme
Theme symbol.

METHOD:: scope
Opens a precision oscilloscope with trigger edge stabilization.
argument:: server
Target server.
argument:: busIndex
Audio bus to monitor.
argument:: numChannels
Channel count.
argument:: theme
Visual theme.
argument:: rate
\audio or \control.
argument:: style
\overlay, \tracks, or \xy.

METHOD:: spectrum
Opens a precision FFT spectrum analyzer with 3-mode switching (\line, \bands, \spectrogram).
argument:: server
Target server.
argument:: busIndex
Audio bus.
argument:: fftSize
FFT size (default 2048).
argument:: theme
Visual theme.
argument:: dbRange
Decibel dynamic range (default 96).
argument:: freqMode
0 for linear, 1 for logarithmic.

METHOD:: spectralDashboard
Opens the 4-preset advanced spectral dashboard.
argument:: server
Target server.
argument:: busIndex
Audio bus.
argument:: theme
Visual theme.

METHOD:: bandAnalyzer
Opens the 16-band ISO octave analyzer.
argument:: server
Target server.
argument:: busIndex
Audio bus.

METHOD:: inspect
Opens the static DSP Graph Inspector for a SynthDef or audio Function.
argument:: synthDef
A SynthDef or Function.
argument:: theme
Visual theme.

EXAMPLES::

code::
s.boot;

// 1. Play test audio
x = { Saw.ar([110, 220]) * 0.2 }.play;

// 2. Open instruments via Probe facade or Server shortcuts
Probe.scope(s, 0, 2);
Probe.spectrum(s, 0);
s.spectralDashboard(0);
s.inspector({ |freq=440| RLPF.ar(Saw.ar(freq), 1200, 0.2) });

// 3. Transparent Signal Tracing
y = { SinOsc.ar(440, 0, 0.1).trace(\sineWave) }.play;
y.free;
::
